OL,3,GNEWSANew vape shop rules insult to     
OL,4,Aindustry, says owner                   
OL,6,FSam Bignell, managing director of      
OL,7,FVapour Central Ltd, said he had spent  
OL,8,F12 years of his life building his      
OL,9,Fstores in Westcliff-on-Sea,            
OL,10,FLeigh-on-Sea and Rayleigh in south     
OL,11,FEssex.                                 
